# drive.press with a mod of broken files (tools/port/mods_synth.py's bad set): every kind cut short or garbage, a road
# for a car, a stored file that doesn't decompress. Each is refused with one line, the cartridge's file is used, and
# the race is drive's to the pixel (docs/port/MODS.md 4).
# until: 0x400000:900
# seconds: 90
# expect: state=0x00400000: players 1, windows 1, cars 6, mode 0, track 0
# args: --mods-dir mods/bad --screenshot-at 1600 --screenshot mods_bad.png
# check: tools/port/mods_check.py log mods_bad.game.log --count "refused: =21" --has "cars/car02.bin (wave 89, car02) refused" --has "its LZSS stream doesn't decompress" --lacks "of the cartridge's files replaced"
# check: tools/port/mods_check.py same mods_bad.png drive.png
5 A            # the controller pak warning
8 START        # the start prompt
11 A           # the main menu: the race
14 A           # the player screen
17 A           # the mode screen: a single race
20 A           # the track select: track 0
23 A           # the car select; the race starts at about 23.6 s and its countdown runs 3.5 s
27 A 20        # gas for 20 s
32 STICKRIGHT 1.5
36 STICKLEFT 1.5
47 B 3         # the brake
